  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Principles of procurement",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Assess the market",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation requires contracting authorities to treat all suppliers equally and without discrimination, and to act in a transparent and proportionate manner.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation also prohibits contracting authorities from designing a procurement process with the intention of excluding it from the scope of procurement legislation, or with a view to artificially narrowing competition.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities must treat suppliers equally and without discrimination throughout all stages of the procurement process. Contracting authorities must always act in a transparent and proportionate manner.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure suppliers are treated equally and without discrimination at all times throughout the procurement process",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "act transparently, including by making information available for the purpose of allowing suppliers and others to understand the authority’s procurement policies and decisions",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure the procurement is designed fairly and proportionately and is not designed with the intention of excluding it from the scope of public procurement rules or to narrow competition.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 12: Covered procurement: objectives",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Principles of procurement",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
